ShortDescription: Local-first AI operating environment for Windows, with a paired Android companion.
Description: |-
  RBG PaRuX AI Studio runs AI models on your own machine. It manages local model downloads and
  runtimes, routes each turn to the model that fits the request and the hardware, and puts chat,
  projects and knowledge, coding agents, Computer Use, image/video/audio generation, datasets and
  training, and workflow automation behind one local control plane.

  Core inference is local and does not require any cloud API. An optional, off-by-default cloud
  fallback can answer a turn when local inference cannot, and says so in the chat when it does.

  A paired Android app can drive a PaRuX PC over your own network; it is a control plane, not a
  second AI runtime.
